   "source": [
    "## 5. Analyses that did not make it into the story\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Geography.** The repository has no country-to-region mapping (see `DATASHEET.md`), so I could not test whether the pattern holds within each continent without adding a new, undocumented source. This is the next check to run.\n",
    "- **Change-level comparison.** Grouping each one-year change by the regime that year (instead of fixing the regime in 2010) gives the same order: hybrid 0.16, authoritarian 0.14, flawed 0.10, full 0.06. I left it out because one country can switch groups, and the country-level version is cleaner.\n",
    "- **Required voting.** We have no compulsory-voting variable in either dataset, so I did not test it.\n",
    "\n",
   ]
  }
